Gale contains code derived from other projects:

- liquidctl (https://github.com/liquidctl/liquidctl), GPL-3.0-or-later.
  Protocol logic in crates/gale-hw-corsair/src/commander_pro.rs, commander_core.rs,
  hydro_platinum.rs and corsair_psu.rs is ported from liquidctl's drivers.
- LibreHardwareMonitor (https://github.com/LibreHardwareMonitor/LibreHardwareMonitor), MPL-2.0.
  The Nuvoton Super I/O driver in crates/gale-hw-superio is ported from
  LibreHardwareMonitorLib/Hardware/Motherboard/Lpc; those files keep their MPL-2.0 headers.
- LibreHardwareMonitor, MPL-2.0 (same project as above): the AMD Zen temperature decode in
  crates/gale-hw-amdcpu/src/decode.rs and the ASUS embedded-controller protocol and board
  tables in crates/gale-hw-asus-ec are ported from LibreHardwareMonitorLib/Hardware/Cpu and
  Hardware/Motherboard/Lpc/EC; those files keep their MPL-2.0 headers.
- RAMSPDToolkit (https://github.com/Blacktempel/RAMSPDToolkit), MPL-2.0.
  The DDR4/DDR5 SPD thermal sensor access in crates/gale-hw-dimm/src/spd.rs is ported from
  RAMSPDToolkit/SPD; that file keeps its MPL-2.0 header.
- PawnIO.Modules (https://github.com/namazso/PawnIO.Modules), LGPL-2.1.
  crates/gale-pawnio embeds the signed LpcIO, AMDFamily17, SmbusPIIX4 and LpcACPIEC module
  binaries unmodified.
